  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : According to Kohlrausch's law\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\wedge_{\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}}^0=\\wedge_{\\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\mathrm{COONa}}^0 +\\wedge_{\\mathrm{HCl}}^0-\\wedge_{\\mathrm{NaCl}}^0 \\\\\n& \\wedge_{\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}}^0=(91+426.16-126.45) \\mathrm{~ohm}^{-1} \\mathrm{~cm}^2 \\mathrm{~eq}^{-1} \\\\\n& \\wedge_{\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}}^0=390.71 \\mathrm{~ohm}^{-1} \\mathrm{~cm}^2 \\mathrm{~eq}^{-1}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
